,"roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9676","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Conjueror","creatorId":"vndb:s27664","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s27664","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s27664","name":"Karolis Januševičius","roleCode":"translator","roleLabel":"翻译","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9677","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Good Haro","creatorId":"vndb:s27755","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s27755","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s27755","name":"T. Emerson","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9678","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Xarrias","creatorId":"vndb:s27861","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s27861","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s27861","name":"Xarrias","roleCode":"qa","roleLabel":"品质保证","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9679","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Gare","creatorId":"vndb:s27662","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s27662","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s27662","name":"Gergely Kovács","roleCode":"editor","roleLabel":"编辑","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9680","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Puffketeer","creatorId":"vndb:s29562","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29562","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29562","name":"Puffketeer","roleCode":"qa","roleLabel":"品质保证","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9681","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Marcussacana","creatorId":"vndb:s27465","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s27465","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s27465","name":"Marcussacana","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9682","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Greg","creatorId":"vndb:s28403","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28403","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28403","name":"Greg","roleCode":"translator","roleLabel":"翻译","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9683","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"佐藤 大助","creatorId":"vndb:s10601","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10601","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10601","name":"佐藤 大助","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9685","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"新川 知","creatorId":"vndb:s11389","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11389","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11389","name":"新川 知","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9686","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"片霧 烈火","creatorId":"vndb:s419","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s419","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s419","name":"片霧 烈火","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9691","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"片霧 烈火","creatorId":"vndb:s419","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s419","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s419","name":"片霧 烈火","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9692","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"みこし まつり","creatorId":"vndb:s1475","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1475","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1475","name":"輿水 隆之","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:9694","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c36509","characterName":"陽坂 穂香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"125244","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"16245"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19441"],"vndbCharacterId":"c36509"},"originalCharacterName":"陽坂 穂香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Honoka, the woman who introduces Osamu to the \"Terrace House Hinosaka,\" is a person of deep sentimentality and gentleness. Yet, she's somewhat susceptible to influence and often finds herself moved to tears by the sorrow of men. She vanishes in an unexpected turn of events, leaving behind her daughter, Mitoko."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36509"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘・美都子にアパートを残し、失踪してしまった母親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"情に厚く優しい性格だが、雰囲気に流されやすく、男の涙にほだされてしまうことも多々ある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19441","sourceWorkId":"9706","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"美都子の母で元々のアパートの大家さん。本来は、美都子を素直ないい娘に育てたことからもわかるように、優しく情に篤い『いい人』だが、少しばかり情に篤すぎるところがあり、すぐに相手の男に同情し、優しく慰めてしまう（精神的にも肉体的にも）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もの凄く流されやすい人で、今回の失踪事件も、相手の男が借金取りに追いかけ回され、『一緒に逃げて欲しい』と頼まれたのをどうしても断り切れずに同行することに。主人公はこの母親を糾弾するが、そもそも彼女に助けられなければ自分も今頃どうなっていたかわからない訳で色々と微妙だったりする。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"125244"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bcde455570a20e6ce1433bb4518110f05b38d79339d185138243847e57b24c19.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aae9c165aedf5b61f3865dc6de7865430786ae0fe8ababe6538e22428832f0d3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"やなせなつみ","creatorId":"vndb:s365","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s365","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s365","name":"やなせ なつみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:16245:125244:4714:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c6237","characterName":"陽坂 美都子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22260","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"16245"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19437"],"vndbCharacterId":"c6237"},"originalCharacterName":"陽坂 美都子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"5月31日"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"144"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The energetic young girl lives uniquely in an old apartment building named \"Terrace House Hinosaka\". After her mother eloped with a man, Mitoko was thrust into the role of landlord, shouldering the responsibility of the building's upkeep."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mitoko is a dynamo around the house, handling all chores with an unmatched proficiency. Her personality is as vibrant as her lifestyle; brisk, cheerful, and tirelessly hardworking. She moves with a certain sprightliness, reminiscent of a small, lively creature, always on the go."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Among her tenants and those around her, Mitoko is a beloved figure. They affectionately refer to her as \"Landlady-chan\", \"Young Landlady-san\", or \"Toko-chan\". Despite their fondness for her, they also see a more complex side to Mitoko."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mitoko's known for her independent streak, often refusing assistance from others and trying to shoulder everything herself. Coupled with her serious nature, she can sometimes be inflexible and stubborn, often led astray by her assumptions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6237"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"住人たちや周囲から愛される少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親である穂香が駆け落ちしてしまったため、オンボロアパートの大家を任されることに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事は万能、ハキハキして明るい頑張り屋な反面、人の手を借りることが苦手で融通が利かず、いろんなことを一人で抱え込みがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それにもめげず、今日も小動物っぽくちょこまか元気に動き回っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19437","sourceWorkId":"9706","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"陽坂 美都子（ひのさか みとこ）声：夏野こおり"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テラスハウス陽の坂の大家代理で、身長144cmの小柄な少女。住人からは「若大家」、友達からは「トコ」「トコちゃん」と呼ばれる。たった一人の肉親である母親が男と駆け落ちしてしまい、『テラスハウス陽の坂』の大家を任されることになる。不幸さでは理と良い勝負である。家事は万能、運動神経も良く、勉強も出来る気だての良い娘。気が強く、弱さを見せようとしない。テラスハウス陽の坂で母親を待とうと決心しているが、一寸先は闇とも言える現実に、内心弱り切っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"癖の強いテラスハウス陽の坂の住人達からもその気立ての良さから信頼されている。しかし住人達は美都子が無理をしている事も見抜いているため、心配している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理に対して当初は「リストラさん」と呼んでいたがある出来事を境に「理くん」へと呼び方が変わっている。それに伴ってか保護者的な感情から恋愛感情へと変化もあった。理に関する女性関係には敏感になり嫉妬することも珍しくなくなった。夏夜や麻実にそれを指摘されると感情的になり否定する。独占欲が強く自分が一番でないと気が済まない。自分がしてはいけない恋をしている事は自覚しているものの初恋でもあるため諦めきれないでいるのが各ルートからも読み取れる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年齢に関する明確な記述はないが、進路に関する描写、理が美都子との仲を穂香に認めさせるためにとった行動などから、物語開始時点で14歳（中学3年生）であることをうかがわせる。ソフ倫の規定により18歳未満の性描写は描けないため、年齢の記述がないほかに美都子の話題の際は「18歳未満の登場人物はいない」などのセリフが多々見られるなど、随所に予防線が張られている。ちなみに声を担当した夏野こおりは収録後に「…これ、犯罪ですよね？」というコメントを残したと、丸戸史明がスタッフ日記で語っている。誕生日は理と同じ5月31日。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22260"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c54a0019d75167376ba0d1f215603a255a8c940361f7d1138b1c4e670422a75.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe8ee7a9a83ef3ca96f400b09c7a5e913775e8ec7b28debb805385eba6e0a361.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田口宏子","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:16245:22260:5020:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c6238","characterName":"香野 麻実","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22261","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"16245"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19438"],"vndbCharacterId":"c6238"},"originalCharacterName":"香野 麻実","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A radiant figure within the school who serves as Mitoko's homeroom teacher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her alluring charm has earned her the affection of both male and female students. Her professional demeanor paints a picture of a confident and competent woman, but away from the public eye, she has a surprising propensity for engaging in petty squabbles."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite her apparent successes, Asami leads a challenging personal life, most notably plagued by her unfortunate misadventures in the realm of romance."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Former wife of Osamu. They divorced two years before the beginning of the game."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6238"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"美都子の担任教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美人で気さく、颯爽としている彼女は、男女問わず、人気が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人の色気漂う女性だが、プライベートでは、以外と低次元の事で争うこともあったり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"こう見えて結構な苦労人で、特に男運がかなり悪い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19438","sourceWorkId":"9706","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"香野 麻実（こうの あさみ）声：一色ヒカル"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美都子の担任の先生で理の2歳年下。学生時代に理と出会い、卒業後に彼と結婚するが2年前に離婚し、教師として再出発する。美人で性格も良く、頼りになるため男女を問わず生徒に人気があり、職場での評判も高い。美都子も彼女の事を信頼しているが、現在自分が置かれている事情（母親が蒸発）を学校側に知られるととんでもない事になるため、避けようとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家族の愛情を知らない理に「子供のいる幸せな家庭を教える」と宣言をして結婚したが、後にある理由からそれを果たせないことを知り、その事実を理に隠して彼女から離婚を切り出して身を引いた。そのため、理に対しての愛情は別れてからもまったく変わっていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生時代からの付き合いで理の事は結構知っている。かなり酔うと理の事で管を巻くように愚痴を言い始めてしまうことが明らかになった。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22261"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/caa3bcf0283e47e67210581ebb93e54f58cdf9206927ca9487652c1ea353a69d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f3dda70588878976dacd1e0bebf0a1bd90a83d9d1bd991c0a7a55ad6773330ba.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中涼子","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:16245:22261:4832:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c6239","characterName":"二号ちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22262","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"16245"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19439"],"vndbCharacterId":"c6239"},"originalCharacterName":"二号ちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"21"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupying a clerical position at the company where Osamu managed to secure his first job post-layoff, Kaya appears lazy at first glance, with her leisurely pace and seemingly absent enthusiasm."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yet, beneath her languid exterior lies an unexpected nurturing side. This becomes evident when she takes in Osamu—left without a place to return after the company's collapse—and offers him a sanctuary in her apartment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Once within her private quarters, her attire—a blend of casual comfort and provocative allure—often leaves Osamu in disarray, unsure where to rest his gaze."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's commonly called \"Number Two\" for some reason..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6239"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が最初に再就職した会社の事務員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見、気だるげでやる気なさそうなマイペースだが、意外と世話好きで、帰れなくなった主人公を自分のマンションに連れてきたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自室内では、ラフできわどい格好をしていることが多く、うれしい反面、目のやり場に困ることもしばしば。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19439","sourceWorkId":"9706","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天城 夏夜（あまぎ かや）声：風音"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理の再就職先の同僚で社長の姪。21歳。仕事も人並み以上にこなせるが、24時間低血圧かのようにテンションが低めで投げやりな言動が多い。理の馬鹿とも言える人の良さと思いやりを間近で見る内に惚れてしまい、テラスハウス陽の坂五号室に転がり込む事になる。そういった経緯から、住人たちからは「二号ちゃん」と呼ばれている。部屋ではワイシャツとショーツのみで過ごし、かなり酒に強い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22262"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c911c0ffe17eb9474c5cf03e84b263844c9177a283022ccf554e9f7d31b5ba8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af9081e442c67ddbc5a1c7e8e777978e62616633c314155d86dccab3f95970cd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井浩美","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:16245:22262:4956:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c6240","characterName":"姫様","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22263","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"16245"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19440"],"vndbCharacterId":"c6240"},"originalCharacterName":"姫様","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Meet Himeo, an esteemed university student hailing from the sophisticated mansion adjacent to Mitoko's apartment. As the scion of a prominent real estate tycoon, Himeo personifies the elegance and grace typically associated with a young lady of high social standing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"To Mitoko, Himeo is an aspirational figure—enthusiastic and ambitious. However, beneath this radiant facade, Himeo possesses a dual nature. Her demeanor shifts dramatically depending on her company, revealing an entirely different side in the presence of adversaries."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Himeo harbors a deep affection for Mitoko, often expressing concern for the young landlady—however, this shared concern kindles conflict between Himeo and Osamu, who equally cherish Mitoko."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c6240"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"オンボロアパートの隣に住む女子大生で、大手不動産グループ社長のご令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"敵味方で態度がコロっとかわる二面性の持ち主で、自分の事を「憧れのお姉さん」と慕ってくる美都子はとても可愛がっているが、逆に、同じように美都子を気にかける主人公とは、真っ向から対立することになり……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19440","sourceWorkId":"9706","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"澤嶋 姫緒（さわしま ひめお）声：芝原のぞみ（PC）／榊原ゆい（PSP）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"国内有数の不動産会社である澤嶋不動産の令嬢で大学生。その出自と名前から、住人たちからは「姫様」と呼ばれる。愛らしさと華やかさを持ち、強面の面々が揃う一族の男性陣に可愛がられている。ボランティア精神に富み、たびたび匿名で多額の寄付をしている。とある事情から美都子に対しては非常に親身に接しており、強引にアパートの隣に引っ越してくる程。しかしその他のアパートの住人にはかなり冷淡な態度を取る。名古屋出身らしく（澤嶋不動産も本社は名古屋）、隣の岐阜出身の理とはご当地ネタで微妙なやりとりを繰り広げる。酒の匂いで悪酔いするほどアルコールに弱い。アルコールに対して耐性が低く、甘酒を一口飲むだけでダウンしてしまうため、酒の席では酔い止めが手放せない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生活が苦しく、苦労を重ねる美都子を見かね、当初は住人を買収して追い出し、孤独になった美都子を引き取ろうと画策する。父親の順平が悪徳不動産王として有名なため、わざとあくどい手口に見せかけていた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22263"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b875ce6d78ab61dca42e38820a8d0944d2da7a2a21aba02d2259b8f7b5db646a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3b822ed2784aaeb03bce6706338603e56a71dcd81d213d566782e4be62661ca.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"たかはし智秋","creatorId":"vndb:s287","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s287","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s287","name":"たかはし 智秋","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:16245:22263:4604:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"榊原ゆい","creatorId":"vndb:s272","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s272","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s272","name":"榊原 ゆい","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","id